{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1555080791"}, "name":{"label":"MarioMJ1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-20T05:48:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.8.9"}, "id":{"label":"14572147175"}, "title":{"label":"Great game!! But…app has bugs."}, "content":{"label":"This game is very fun to play, and I love playing on iPad! However, app has bugs that hasn’t been fixed for awhile.\n1: app crashes on most screens on iPhone even after reinstall\n2. When starting a challenge, that requires in game currency to redo if not completed or wanting to redo, will spawn your plane then immediately say you crashed. Watch the replay and the plane is perfectly fine in the air then the screen just says dead.\n3. Landing challenges spawn you often time close to the runway going over 250 knots and forces you to quickly change view to cockpit, doesn’t save previous views sometimes, immediately set flaps, and full air brakes.\n\nUpdated: forgot that when doing their daily challenge it has a button to view the rank 1 landing but it hasn’t worked once since playing for months. I would love to use the feature provided in the game till see what rank 1 like like, but I guess we will never know", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
