{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1954482059"}, "name":{"label":"Aragorn 3526"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-07T14:38:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.8"}, "id":{"label":"14400466713"}, "title":{"label":"Great Game, but Always Crashes"}, "content":{"label":"I have been looking for a good flight simulator for a while and this was exactly what I was looking for. It has like no adds, great physics, a wide variety of planes, and there is always something to do. The main problem was, though, that it always crashed. When I first got the game it did not do this, but later on it crashed every few seconds to the point that I had to delete it because I basically could not play it. I still really like the game, though, and it is still the best flight sim I ever played, but if the devs could look into this and figure out why it crashed so much and fix it, that would be amazing!!!\n\nBtw, I never leave reviews on games, but because I like this one so much and want to be able to play it again, I left a review. Bye!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1333476679&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-25T02:49:11-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
